================================================================================
PARITY (web components/feedback/ReloadPrompt.tsx -> native)
================================================================================
Data sources : useTranslation -> P1/S10 ReloadPromptStrings facade; useRegisterSW -> ReloadPromptSource
               seam (needRefresh -> updateAvailable; updateServiceWorker(true) -> applyUpdate();
               setNeedRefresh(false) -> dismiss(); registration.update() -> refresh()).
Literals      : COUNTDOWN_SECONDS=3 and UPDATE_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS=5*60*1000 (=300s) lifted + unit-asserted.
Countdown     : web `prev <= 1 ? (reload, 0) : prev-1` ported as ReloadCountdown.next, driven 1/s by the
               banner's .task (web setInterval(...,1000)); auto-reload at zero; "Reload Now"/"Later".
i18n keys     : pwa.newVersion, pwa.reloadingIn ("Reloading in {{seconds}}s..." — token kept verbatim),
               pwa.later, pwa.reloadNow — all resolve through the facade; plus native leaf chrome keys.
States        : loading / empty (friendly "up to date" vs web null) / error (QueryError peer) / data
               (the banner) / stale + offline (freshness chip) — every state renders, no blank box.
A11y          : banner is one combined VoiceOver element (web role="alert"/aria-live="polite") with the
               countdown marked .updatesFrequently; Later + Reload Now individually focusable + labelled;
               spinner honours Reduce Motion (static glyph); Dynamic Type via tokens.
Telemetry     : view.opened emitted once with surface slug "ReloadPrompt" (P1/S11), unit-asserted.

